From f9175224cd9ab75887945644eb98ca7a62d171d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 9 Jul 2025 14:37:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: st: enable the debug bus on stm32mp2x boards

On stm32mp2x boards, enable the debug bus so we always try to probe
the debug peripherals, if the debug configuration allows it.

Signed-off-by: Gatien Chevallier <gatien.chevallier@foss.st.com>
Change-Id: I56b1c458a89d5c6f28e0e33efd90196d046de27d
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/473656
Reviewed-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Amelie DELAUNAY <amelie.delaunay@foss.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp215f-dk.dts  | 4 ++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp235f-dk.dts  | 4 ++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp257f-dk.dts  | 4 ++++
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp257f-ev1.dts | 4 ++++
 4 files changed, 16 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp215f-dk.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp215f-dk.dts
index 194de2b62ed3..77b5159d875b 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp215f-dk.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/st/stm32mp215f-dk.dts
@@ -267,6 +267,10 @@ csi_source: endpoint {
 	};
 };
 
+&dbg_bus {
+	status = "okay";
+};
+
 &dcmipp {
 	status = "okay";
 	port {
